{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>בה שעתא, נברשתא</b> — נורה." "<b>על גירא</b> — like stones of גיר, and it is lime." "<b>כותל היכלא</b> — like אחר כתלינו." "<b>פס ידא</b> — a piece of hand, and likewise: יהי פסת בר. Also כתונת פסים, and all is derived from the root of כי פסו אמונים, and behold they saw hands without a body."], :book :daniel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Daniel - Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/daniel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:19:57.430923066Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}